msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/installation-guide.rst:162
#: 08db34b6b18d4b618e50fb5b321aa3de
msgid ""
"The Qubes OS installer is completely offline. It doesn’t even load any "
"networking drivers, so there is no possibility of internet-based data leaks "
"or attacks during the installation process."
