#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/installation-guide.rst:164
#: 38f8290040084cd8af276aa06f1565c7
msgid ""
"The Installation summary screen allows you to change how the system will be "
"installed and configured, including localization settings. At minimum, you "
